    "detailed_description": "<strong>room rpg</strong> is an action-packed turn-based RPG incorporating both skill based mechanics and in-depth RPG strategy, featuring high octane bullet battles and skill customization allowing you to perfect your build for whatever situation may come and for whatever dastardly, strange foe you must pummel. Starring Michael Softwindows, the worst baseball player at his middle school, a complete failure on a quest for redemption. He would really rather go back to sleep, but with his trusty talking baseball bat anything is possible. Including even more debilitating failure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/bba58897d439958907bcf4d1c9ed8c04.poster.avif?t=1724444399\" width=252 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/bba58897d439958907bcf4d1c9ed8c04.webm?t=1724444399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/bba58897d439958907bcf4d1c9ed8c04.mp4?t=1724444399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/ab86032317cf05cf27ba24085b362a80.poster.avif?t=1724444399\" width=254 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/ab86032317cf05cf27ba24085b362a80.webm?t=1724444399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/ab86032317cf05cf27ba24085b362a80.mp4?t=1724444399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Turn-based battles with a twist!</strong> Defend against bullet-hell lite enemy attacks inspired by the <i>UNDERTALE</i> series, and dish out your own skill-based spells and tactics similar to the <i>Mario &amp; Luigi</i> and <i>Paper Mario</i> series to get the upper hand!<br></li><li> <strong>Gain extra turns</strong> by exploiting enemy weaknesses and strike them out of existence!<br></li><li> <strong>Customize skills</strong> by equipping different pins, allowing you to have a unique set of skills perfect for whatever combat scenario you're in! <br></li><li> <strong> A very silly story</strong> about anything but actually playing baseball! <br></li><li> <strong>One entire boy's room to explore!</strong> <br></li><li><strong> Inspiration from <i>Earthbound </i></strong>  with themes of <strong>SOMETHING</strong> or <strong>ANOTHER...!</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/e5f9f0cfb884a8f929c8e25ab958df3b.avif?t=1724444399\" width=508 height=240 /></span>",
