t-hell lite enemy attacks inspired by the <i>UNDERTALE</i> series, and dish out your own skill-based spells and tactics similar to the <i>Mario &amp; Luigi</i> and <i>Paper Mario</i> series to get the upper hand!<br></li><li> <strong>Gain extra turns</strong> by exploiting enemy weaknesses and strike them out of existence!<br></li><li> <strong>Customize skills</strong> by equipping different pins, allowing you to have a unique set of skills perfect for whatever combat scenario you're in! <br></li><li> <strong> A very silly story</strong> about anything but actually playing baseball! <br></li><li> <strong>One entire boy's room to explore!</strong> <br></li><li><strong> Inspiration from <i>Earthbound </i></strong>  with themes of <strong>SOMETHING</strong> or <strong>ANOTHER...!</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/e5f9f0cfb884a8f929c8e25ab958df3b.avif?t=1724444399\" width=508 height=240 /></span>",
